{"id":"cabinet:gem+gemr","view34":"PASS","quality":"FAIL","reason":"The middle shelf cyan cluster (clu6) spans the full bay like a flat symmetric 3-pronged tiara/crown and the cut gems (oct5, sm4, sm5) are boxy rectangles wrapped in heavy dark outlines."}
{"id":"cabinet:bolt+boltg+boltr","view34":"PASS","quality":"FAIL","reason":"The top and middle bays hang tiny 4-5px blocks from a 1px horizontal rod that read as small bottles/jars with labels rather than bolts of cloth, and the bottom stacks have harsh dark left-edge notches."}
{"id":"cabinet:bottle+bottler+bottley","view34":"PASS","quality":"FAIL","reason":"The round red flasks/jugs (flask5, jug5) with 1px cork stems read like apples/tomatoes, and the bright 3px tan labels at the bottom of wine5 make the green/red bottles look like stoppers sitting in tan cups."}
{"id":"cabinet:candle","view34":"PASS","quality":"FAIL","reason":"The middle-left lit pillar (litp) has a dark wick pixel inside the pale wax face that reads like a punched luggage tag, and the 4px-wide red/blue tapers on equally wide yellow bases read as striped canisters/batteries."}
{"id":"cabinet:cheese","view34":"PASS","quality":"FAIL","reason":"The wedges (wedge5s, wedge5, wedge4) are 45-degree right triangles in flat side profile without a distinct 3/4 top plane vs vertical cut face, repeated in top/bottom pairs around an indistinct red-and-cream middle blob."}
